dist/
node_modules/
# The SPA build, copied in by @rockysurf/web's build (scripts/sync-web-bundle.mjs). Generated,
# never committed. The two siblings are that script's swap scratch, left behind only if it is
# interrupted mid-copy.
public/
public.build/
public.prev/
# `packages/core/packs` is COMMITTED, not ignored — see scripts/check-packs-bundle.mjs for why.
# Only the swap scratch belongs here, and only when the sync is interrupted mid-copy.
#
# LEADING SLASH, and it is load-bearing rather than tidy. A bare `packs.build/` would be fine,
# but a bare `packs/` matches a directory of that name at ANY depth — including `src/packs/`,
# the pack loader's own source directory. Written unanchored it silently excluded a new file
# there from a commit, and the branch went up importing a module that was not in it. Anchor
# every directory pattern in this file to the package root.
/packs.build/
/packs.prev/
